\v 14 I am debtor both to Greeks and to foreigners, both to the wise and to the foolish. 
\v 15 So as much as is in me, I am eager to preach the Good News to you also who are in Rome. 
\v 16 For I am not ashamed of the Good News of Christ, because it is the power of God for salvation for everyone who believes, for the Jew first, and also for the Greek. 
